/qa/_*.mjs

# The designer's source artwork, kept on disk and out of the repository.
# `public/branding/banner-*.jpg` are the five pieces the site actually serves;
# the originals they were copied from, plus three files that are not banners,
# all arrived as `.jpeg` and are 30 MB of duplicates nothing reads.
#
# Matched on the EXTENSION and not on the name. `Banner*` looked like the
# obvious rule and silently excluded the five served files as well: git honours
# core.ignorecase on macOS, so the pattern matched `banner-1-cuisine.jpg` too
# and the site would have been pushed without a single banner in it.
/public/branding/*.jpeg
